  << /ActualText (I\031m a junior designer and illustrator with a multidisciplinary background in art\054 design and multimedia\056 My work combines visual communication\054 illustration and digital design\054 with a particular interest in service design and inclusive experiences\056 I believe design can make information more accessible and meaningful\054 bringing people together through purposeful and thoughtful solutions\056 I\031m particularly interested in further developing my expertise in packaging and product communication while contributing to multidisciplinary projects\056)
