1144 0 obj
  << /ActualText (UX\057ui design\nat IEFP\n2026\nDeepened my knowledge of UX\057UI design\054 information architecture\054 project planning and management\056\nDeveloped prototyping and interface design skills\054 complemented by foundational knowledge of HTML\054 CSS and Bootstrap\056\n\nMaster\031s in Design and Multimedia \015\nat Universidade de Coimbra\n2022\0552025\nDeveloped a multidisciplinary foundation in multimedia design\054 with a focus on accessibility\054 universal design\054 interaction and usability\056\nGained experience in front\055end development\054 exploring the intersection of design and technology to create inclusive digital experiences\056\n\nBachelor\031s in Art and Design \015\nat Escola Superior de Educa\347\343o do Instituto Polit\351cnico de Coimbra\n2019\0552022\nGained multidisciplinary training in graphic design\054 communication design\054 product design and interior design\056\nExplored diverse design approaches and developed my skills in drawing\054 illustration\054 composition and visual concept development\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 1145 0 R
     /Pg 1132 0 R
