1146 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Illustrator \046 ux\057ui designer\nat Kranemann Wine Estates \050part of my master thesis\051\n2023\0552025\nDesigned a digital application featuring illustrations that explain the winemaking process\054 helping clients better understand the information presented\056\nDesigned the user interface and developed the illustrative elements\054 drawing on illustration techniques\054 design systems and UX\057UI principles\056\nUsed Figma and Adobe Illustrator to establish a consistent visual language and create an intuitive user experience\056\n\nFreelance Illustrator \046 Branding Designer\nin Branding\054 Illustration and Visual Communication\n2019\055present\nDeveloped visual identities and creative concepts for projects in sports\054 animal welfare and music\054 creating visual assets adapted to different brands and communication needs\056\nDesigned a range of graphic materials\054 including merchandise\054 price lists\054 printed materials and digital content for social media\056\nCreated graphic elements for bicycle seatposts\054 adapting visual concepts to specific products and their intended applications\056\nApplied branding and visual communication principles to maintain consistency across different media and formats\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1147 0 R
